Patches applied to the pristine dosfstools-4.2 tarball by ../unpack.sh.

They apply with `patch -p1` from inside src/, in filename order.  Each one
starts with a few lines of prose saying what it does and why, then the diff.

  0001-blkgetsize64-no-version-check.patch
        The device size comes from BLKGETSIZE64 without a kernel version
        test on the uname() release (which is the LikeOS version here).

  0002-mounted-check-proc-mounts.patch
        The "is it mounted" check reads /proc/mounts when there is no
        /etc/mtab.

